{
 "version": 1,
 "name": "eBGP chain",
 "about": "Three routers in three ASes, R1-R2-R3, each originating its LAN. R2-R3 is cut and restored (eBGP sessions end at once when the cable loses carrier). Keepalive 1 s, hold 3 s, connect retry 5 s.",
